  "DivisionNotes": [
    "BinarySearch is a PlusCal-translated algorithm with TLAPS-checked safety proof; ActionDefNames are 'a' (the body of the while loop, contains primed variables) and 'Next' (disjunction of actions).",
    "Init is the standard initial-state predicate; TypeOK, Inv, resultCorrect, Terminating are state predicates (the latter is a stuttering action but is also a state predicate combined with UNCHANGED vars and is treated as a terminating-state predicate here).",
    "Spec and Termination are the temporal-formula definitions and are placed in OperatorDefNames_TemporalProperty.",
    "TemporalNesting is false: properties involve []resultCorrect and <>(pc=\"Done\") but no nesting of [] inside <> or vice versa."
  ]
